SUMMARY:Latinos & Latinas Run Club
DESCRIPTION:Come connect with us over a run! Hosted by Latinos Run and Latinas Run of Raleigh & Durham\, all paces and people are welcome weekly starting at 6:30pm. We’ll follow a 3–4 mile route through downtown Durham before returning to us here at Glass Jug Downtown for drinks and camaraderie. Latinos Run and Latinas Run are nationwide running organizations dedicated to empowering and connecting communities through running\, wellness\, and culture. Their mission is to create a supportive\, inclusive space where individuals of all backgrounds and fitness levels feel welcomed and encouraged to move their bodies and build meaningful connections. You can learn more about the organizations here: https://www.latinasrunclub.com/ and https://www.latinosrun.com/ We aim to be a welcoming space for runners to connect\, move\, and enjoy each other’s company – so join us\, Latinos Run\, and Latinas Run every Thursday! View on Facebook.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/latinos-latinas-run-club-2/
LOCATION:The Glass Jug Downtown\, 545 Foster Street\, Suite 10\, Durham\, 27701
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/image-2026-06-12T010132.953.jpg
GEO:36.0014902;-78.9018252
