SUMMARY:Future Fest Connect
DESCRIPTION:Future Fest Connect is a gaming and technology expo designed to introduce school-aged students\, college students\, and early-career professionals to the world of game development and emerging technology. Through hands-on experiences\, industry speakers\, and interactive learning opportunities\, attendees can explore career pathways in gaming\, technology\, and creative innovation. \nThe event features the Epic Games Learning Lab\, Durham’s First Indie Game Awards\, independent game developers\, resume and portfolio reviews by industry professionals\, networking opportunities\, and cutting-edge showcases—including a flying car. \nFuture Fest Connect celebrates the future of gaming and technology by connecting developers\, creatives\, educators\, and industry leaders with the community. Our mission is to bridge the gap between industry and community through gaming and technology by creating a space where ideas are shared\, career questions are answered\, and meaningful connections are built. \nFuture Fest Connect is a pipeline to the future you want.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/future-fest-connect/
LOCATION:Durham Convention Center\, 301 W. Morgan St.\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Conference / Convention
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Logo-Design-ver6.png
GEO:35.9975142;-78.9023468
