SUMMARY:Sip & Create: Soap Making Workshop
DESCRIPTION:This hands-on experience is perfect for a night out with friends\, a creative date\, or a solo self-care event. Enjoy a relaxed brewery atmosphere on Saturday August 8th from 2-4pm while crafting nourishing\, handcrafted soaps you’ll be proud to take home. \nWhat You’ll Make:\nDuring the workshop\, you’ll create a custom set of handcrafted goat’s milk soaps inspired by springtime renewal. Choose from a vibrant palette of colors\, natural botanicals\, and refreshing fragrances such as lavender\, lemon\, eucalyptus\, soft florals\, citrus blends\, and other fresh herbal notes. Bring your creative energy and get ready to swirl colors\, blend scents\, layer botanicals\, and personalize your soaps step-by-step with guided instruction. Your finished creations will be bright\, cheerful\, and perfect for gifting or enhancing your self-care routine—perfect for beginners and experienced makers alike! \nWhy Goat’s Milk Soap?\nGoat’s milk soap is naturally moisturizing and rich in vitamins A\, D\, and E. It’s gentle on the skin\, suitable for all skin types\, and especially refreshing as we transition from winter into spring. \nTickets (available here):\n• $35 – One 8oz Soap Bar (plus Eventbrite fees)\n• Optional upgrades available at checkout\n• Tons of molds to choose from! \nPlease Note:\n• Guests are welcome to purchase beverages from Glass Jug\n• Workshop runs approximately 2 hours\n• No experience needed – all materials and tools are provided\n• Refunds available up to 7 days before the event\n• Maximum late entry: 20 minutes after the start time\n• Each attendee must have their own ticket – no ticket sharing.\n• Family-friendly! Kids are welcome with an accompanying adult. \nJoin us on August 8th at 2 PM for an uplifting afternoon filled with creativity\, connection\, and beautiful handcrafted goat’s milk soaps. Step into the season refreshed and inspired. \nView on Facebook.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/sip-create-soap-making-workshop/
LOCATION:The Glass Jug Downtown\, 545 Foster Street\, Suite 10\, Durham\, 27701
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Soap-Making-Workshop.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="The Glass Jug Beer Lab - Downtown Durham":MAILTO:marketing@glass-jug.com
GEO:36.0014902;-78.9018252
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Glass Jug Downtown 545 Foster Street Suite 10 Durham 27701;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=545 Foster Street\, Suite 10:geo:-78.9018252,36.0014902
END:VEVENT
