SUMMARY:Sunday DRIFT Rooftop DJ Sets at The Velvet Hippo!
DESCRIPTION:Every Sunday from 4-7pm\, you’ll hear music drifting from the rooftop on Orange Street! Our Sunday afternoon DJ sets are a great way to end your weekend on a high note. Get your crew together to spill the tea while you sip on spritz and mimosa specials and watch the sun get low over the Bull City skyline. This series rotates through your favorite Velvet Hippo DJs\, and once a month\, the Sunday DRIFT will be a Recovery Tea Dance Edition with Gay Agenda and Father Disco! No cover\, 21+ to enter.
