SUMMARY:Next Stop Broadway
DESCRIPTION:A Summer Intensive for Theatre Lovers Ages 10-17 \nBack by popular demand! We’re thrilled to announce that Next Stop Broadway® will return to DPAC this summer from August 10-14\, 2026. \nNext Stop Broadway® is a week-long program consisting of classes\, workshops\, and rehearsals focused on classic Broadway shows. A staff of Broadway professionals teach participants songs and choreography from hit shows from the “Golden Age of Broadway\,” and participants work together throughout the week to create unique skits. The program culminates with an “Opening Night” performance for family and friends on DPAC’s stage. \nThis summer intensive encourages teamwork and is designed to teach the importance of building a strong Ensemble. All participants are part of the Ensemble; no auditions are required\, and there are no “lead” roles. Previous theater experience is celebrated but not necessary\, and anyone with an interest in the performing arts is welcome. \nNext Stop Broadway® registration will open on Thursday\, January 29 at 10:00AM. We advise that any interested parents act quickly to reserve a space\, as in the past this program has sold out within hours. \nWith a grant from DPAC of over $13\,000\, twenty participants will receive fully paid scholarships to attend the program at no cost. Scholarship applications may be submitted at any time between now and March 1\, 2026.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/next-stop-broadway/2026-08-10/
LOCATION:DPAC Presented by First Horizon\, 123 Vivian St / William V. "Bill" Bell Way\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Classes & Workshops,Theater
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/NextStopBroadway1080x1080.jpg
GEO:35.9939816;-78.9026312
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=DPAC Presented by First Horizon 123 Vivian St / William V. "Bill" Bell Way Durham 27701;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=123 Vivian St / William V. "Bill" Bell Way:geo:-78.9026312,35.9939816
END:VEVENT
