SUMMARY:Fabulous Felted Fungi Workshop @ Future Hooman
DESCRIPTION:Create your very own whimsical fungi in this needle felting workshop! Guided instruction and all materials provided.\nWhether you are a beginner or could be leading the group yourself\, we will use basic needle felting techniques to shape soft wool into adorable\, life-like mushrooms.\nWith guided instruction and all materials provided\, you’ll leave with a one-of-a-kind handmade creation and the skills to continue felting at home. Let your creativity bloom in this fun and relaxing crafting session!\nAdmission to the Future Hooman art exhibit is included in the price.
